"subscriptions.patch","subscriptions.delete"],"id":"gcp.pubsub.subscriptions.crud","l":"full","t":"Subscriptions (create, list, get, patch, delete)","x":[]},{"a":["subscriptions.pull","subscriptions.acknowledge"],"id":"gcp.pubsub.subscriptions.pull-ack","l":"full","t":"Pull, acknowledge, ack-deadline redelivery, message retention","x":["A message not acknowledged within ackDeadlineSeconds becomes eligible for redelivery the next time the subscription is pulled, rather than on a background timer."]},{"a":["subscriptions.create","subscriptions.pull"],"id":"gcp.pubsub.subscriptions.dead-lettering","l":"full","t":"Dead-letter topic after maxDeliveryAttempts","x":[]},{"a":[],"id":"gcp.pubsub.subscriptions.push","l":"limited","t":"Push delivery config","x":["pushConfig.pushEndpoint is stored and returned exactly as configured."]},{"a":["subscriptions.create","subscriptions.pull","subscriptions.acknowledge"],"id":"gcp.pubsub.subscriptions.ordering-exactly-once","l":"limited","t":"Message ordering and exactly-once delivery flags","x":["enableMessageOrdering is ENFORCED: when set, the next message for a given orderingKey is never delivered until the earlier message with that key has been acknowledged, even if its own ack deadline has lapsed."]},{"a":["subscriptions.create","subscriptions.pull"],"id":"gcp.pubsub.subscriptions.retry-policy","l":"full","t":"Retry policy (immediate vs. exponential backoff)","x":["minimumBackoff/maximumBackoff are ENFORCED: a redelivery is withheld until the exponential backoff window (capped at maximumBackoff) has elapsed, not just the ack deadline."]},{"a":["subscriptions.create","topics.publish","subscriptions.pull"],"id":"gcp.pubsub.subscriptions.filter","l":"limited","t":"Subscription message filter","x":["A documented subset of the filter language is evaluated at publish time: attributes.key = \"value\", attributes.key != \"value\", hasPrefix(attributes.key, \"prefix\"), attributes:\"key\" (has-attribute), NOT/AND/OR and parentheses."]},{"a":["subscriptions.create","subscriptions.patch","topics.publish"],"id":"gcp.pubsub.subscriptions.bigquery-gcs-delivery","l":"limited","t":"Write to BigQuery / write to Cloud Storage delivery","x":["Write to Cloud Storage delivery is ENFORCED: each delivered message is written as a real newline-delimited TEXT object into the configured bucket (named from filenamePrefix/filenameSuffix) in Vyomi's own GCS store — never queued on the subscription. The bucket must already exist; avroConfig output isn't modeled."]},{"a":["topics.create","topics.patch","topics.get","topics.publish","subscriptions.pull"],"id":"gcp.pubsub.topics.ingestion","l":"limited","t":"Topic ingestion from external sources (AWS/Azure/Kafka/CDC)","x":["ingestionDataSourceSettings.cloudStorage is ENFORCED: a topic configured with it really ingests objects from a real GCS bucket as messages (one message per object, matching matchGlob if set), lazily catching up on the next topics.get/publish or a pull on one of its subscriptions — Vyomi has no background poller, so a brand-new object doesn't appear until something next touches the topic."]},{"a":["topics.create","topics.patch","topics.publish"],"id":"gcp.pubsub.topics.message-transforms","l":"limited","t":"Message transforms (JavaScript UDFs on publish)","x":["A documented SUBSET of JavaScript is really parsed and executed against every published message (not a fixed menu of transform kinds): const/let, property get/set, delete, if/else, return, object/array literals + spread, JSON.parse/stringify, a few String/Object/Array builtins (toUpperCase/toLowerCase/trim/includes/startsWith/endsWith/split/join/keys/isArray), +, ===, !==, &&, ||, !."]},{"a":["topics.publish","subscriptions.pull","subscriptions.acknowledge"],"id":"gcp.pubsub.metrics","l":"limited","t":"Topic / subscription metrics and monitoring charts","x":["Three series are mirrored into the shared Cloud Monitoring store from the core's OWN activity (never synthetic/random data): pubsub.googleapis.com/topic/send_message_operation_count (a live cumulative publish count), subscription/num_undelivered_messages (the subscription's real current backlog) and subscription/oldest_unacked_message_age, refreshed on every publish/pull/acknowledge/get."]},{"a":["snapshots.create","snapshots.get","snapshots.list","snapshots.delete","subscriptions.seek"],"id":"gcp.pubsub.snapshots.crud","l":"full","t":"Snapshots (create, list, get, delete) and seek","x":[]},{"a":["schemas.create","schemas.get","schemas.list","schemas.delete"],"id":"gcp.pubsub.schemas.crud","l":"full","t":"Schemas (create, list, get, delete)","x":[]}],"id":"pubsub","ops":44,"registry_unreachable":[],"title":"Pub/Sub","total":46}
